            "title": "Banks have a busy week: Fed decision, Goldman conference, & more",
            "description": "<p>It's an important week for banks and the financial sector (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/XLF\">XLF</a>), from the Federal Reserve's interest rate decision to Goldman Sachs's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GS\">GS</a>) industry conference.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/david-hollerith/\">David Hollerith</a> joins Market Domination Overtime host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> to outline what's in store for the sector this week.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination-overtime/\">Market Domination Overtime</a>.</p>",
